Z||000001||stimpy||04-25-2000||08:16 AM||||I risk excommunication should ye be unworthy, but I shall reveal all secrets, HAHAHHAH!<BR>On a cold dark night once you have proven you mettle by spilling your blood on a frozen bolt, you will be taken onto the lowland plains by High Priest Cliff and his assistant Ogre.  Once there you face the inquistion of Monkeyman and Oreif (hints: there is no Lotus-designed suspension, Indy's were only made in 84, and never let air get in your radiator lines) Once you have proven your knowledge, you shall reciev the sacred sign of the pegasus on yer rump, administered by Patrick. This is a pain in the ass that is slow to go away, but if you ignore it, you realize how irrelevent it is.<BR>Then and only then shall you be welcomed to the fold, You shal partake in frosty glasses of fine malted beverages with the likes of GT Bastard, DXR_DAD, Standard, and Shiner. You can trade barbs and witty repartee with 2M4Dale, mwbackus, and RFMike.  <BR>All hail Jeff's 86.5 GT, HOO-rah!||||reg||1
Z||000002||lennyb4||04-25-2000||08:30 AM||||Remember these things my friend and your journey to membership shall be devine..<BR>  <BR> 1.) Greater is he who is in a FIERO. You         shall be delivered from the power of         fords and ricers into the kindom of          Pontiac.<BR> 2.) You now come before the Throne room          (cliff,orge, all fiero lovers)               boldly. You are more then a conqueror        or average man. You are in the light         of knowledge. You have entered the           sacred halls of Pontiac. <P>  Now go forth my son, and hold your head high and the gas petal down as you face the temptations of Fords and Chevy's and Ricers oh my..||||reg||6
Z||000003||DJRice||04-25-2000||08:59 AM||||uhh, you have to do all that stuff, and, umm, give my car a wash and wax too.<P>Yeah, thats it.<P>-or-<P>You might have to wait until you hit 10 forum posts...<BR>||||reg||1
